{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Eio_unix.File</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"eio","href":"../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Eio_unix","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"File","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Extended file API with support for file descriptors.</p><ul class=\"at-tags\"><li class=\"since\"><span class=\"at-tag\">since</span> 1.6</li></ul>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-rw_ty\"><a href=\"#type-rw_ty\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> rw_ty</span><span> = </span><span>[ </span></code><ol><li id=\"type-rw_ty.Unix_fd\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-rw_ty.Unix_fd\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Unix_fd</span></code></li><li id=\"type-rw_ty.Eio.File.rw_ty\" class=\"def variant type anchored\"><a href=\"#type-rw_ty.Eio.File.rw_ty\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><a href=\"../../Eio/File/index.html#type-rw_ty\">Eio.File.rw_ty</a></span></code></li></ol><code><span> ]</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-ro_ty\"><a href=\"#type-ro_ty\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> ro_ty</span><span> = </span><span>[ </span></code><ol><li id=\"type-ro_ty.Unix_fd\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-ro_ty.Unix_fd\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Unix_fd</span></code></li><li id=\"type-ro_ty.Eio.File.ro_ty\" class=\"def variant type anchored\"><a href=\"#type-ro_ty.Eio.File.ro_ty\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><a href=\"../../Eio/File/index.html#type-ro_ty\">Eio.File.ro_ty</a></span></code></li></ol><code><span> ]</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-import_rw\"><a href=\"#val-import_rw\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> import_rw : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">sw</span>:<a href=\"../../Eio/Switch/index.html#type-t\">Eio.Std.Switch.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">close_unix</span>:bool <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Unix</span>.file_descr <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"#type-rw_ty\">rw_ty</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../../Eio/Std/index.html#type-r\">Eio.Std.r</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>import_rw ~sw ~close_unix fd</code> is a read/write Eio file that uses <code>fd</code>.</p><p>The file resource will be closed when <code>sw</code> finishes.</p><p>The backend takes ownership of <code>fd</code> and may change whether it is non-blocking.</p><p>The <code>close_unix</code> and <code>sw</code> arguments are passed to <a href=\"../Fd/index.html#val-of_unix\"><code>Fd.of_unix</code></a>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-import_ro\"><a href=\"#val-import_ro\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> import_ro : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">sw</span>:<a href=\"../../Eio/Switch/index.html#type-t\">Eio.Std.Switch.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">close_unix</span>:bool <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Unix</span>.file_descr <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>[&lt; <a href=\"#type-ro_ty\">ro_ty</a> ]</span> <a href=\"../../Eio/Std/index.html#type-r\">Eio.Std.r</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>import_ro</code> is like <a href=\"#val-import_rw\"><code>import_rw</code></a>, but casts the result to be read-only.</p></div></div>"}